{
  "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
  "sourceName": "Saheeh International",
  "language": "en",
  "direction": "ltr",
  "surahNumber": 84,
  "entries": [
    {
      "verseKey": "84:1",
      "surahNumber": 84,
      "ayahNumber": 1,
      "text": "When the sky has split [open]",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "84:2",
      "surahNumber": 84,
      "ayahNumber": 2,
      "text": "And has listened [i.e., responded] to its Lord and was obligated [to do so]",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "84:3",
      "surahNumber": 84,
      "ayahNumber": 3,
      "text": "And when the earth has been extended",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "84:4",
      "surahNumber": 84,
      "ayahNumber": 4,
      "text": "And has cast out that within it and relinquished [it]",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "84:5",
      "surahNumber": 84,
      "ayahNumber": 5,
      "text": "And has listened [i.e., responded] to its Lord and was obligated [to do so] –",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "84:6",
      "surahNumber": 84,
      "ayahNumber": 6,
      "text": "O mankind, indeed you are laboring toward your Lord with [great] exertion and will meet it.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "84:7",
      "surahNumber": 84,
      "ayahNumber": 7,
      "text": "Then as for he who is given his record in his right hand,",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "84:8",
      "surahNumber": 84,
      "ayahNumber": 8,
      "text": "He will be judged with an easy account",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "84:9",
      "surahNumber": 84,
      "ayahNumber": 9,
      "text": "And return to his people in happiness.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "84:10",
      "surahNumber": 84,
      "ayahNumber": 10,
      "text": "But as for he who is given his record behind his back,",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "84:11",
      "surahNumber": 84,
      "ayahNumber": 11,
      "text": "He will cry out for destruction",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "84:12",
      "surahNumber": 84,
      "ayahNumber": 12,
      "text": "And [enter to] burn in a Blaze.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "84:13",
      "surahNumber": 84,
      "ayahNumber": 13,
      "text": "Indeed, he had [once] been among his people in happiness;",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "84:14",
      "surahNumber": 84,
      "ayahNumber": 14,
      "text": "Indeed, he had thought he would never return [to Allāh].",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "84:15",
      "surahNumber": 84,
      "ayahNumber": 15,
      "text": "But yes! Indeed, his Lord was ever, of him, Seeing.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "84:16",
      "surahNumber": 84,
      "ayahNumber": 16,
      "text": "So I swear by the twilight glow",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "84:17",
      "surahNumber": 84,
      "ayahNumber": 17,
      "text": "And [by] the night and what it envelops",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "84:18",
      "surahNumber": 84,
      "ayahNumber": 18,
      "text": "And [by] the moon when it becomes full",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "84:19",
      "surahNumber": 84,
      "ayahNumber": 19,
      "text": "[That] you will surely embark upon [i.e., experience] state after state.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "84:20",
      "surahNumber": 84,
      "ayahNumber": 20,
      "text": "So what is [the matter] with them [that] they do not believe,",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "84:21",
      "surahNumber": 84,
      "ayahNumber": 21,
      "text": "And when the Qur’ān is recited to them, they do not prostrate [to Allāh]?",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "84:22",
      "surahNumber": 84,
      "ayahNumber": 22,
      "text": "But those who have disbelieved deny,",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "84:23",
      "surahNumber": 84,
      "ayahNumber": 23,
      "text": "And Allāh is most knowing of what they keep within themselves.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "84:24",
      "surahNumber": 84,
      "ayahNumber": 24,
      "text": "So give them tidings of a painful punishment,",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "84:25",
      "surahNumber": 84,
      "ayahNumber": 25,
      "text": "Except for those who believe and do righteous deeds. For them is a reward uninterrupted.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    }
  ]
}
